description:
Review of dekyil-v2-jm3 found that lib/schema.ts lines 461-466 export static pre-built schema objects:

  export const AboutUsSchema = buildAboutUsSchema("en", "/about-us")
  export const SuiteRoomSchema = buildSuiteRoomSchema("en")
  export const DeluxeRoomSchema = buildDeluxeRoomSchema("en")
  export const DeluxeBreadCrumb = buildDeluxeBreadCrumb("en")
  export const SuiteBreadCrumb = buildSuiteBreadCrumb("en")
  export const HotelSchema = buildHotelSchema("en")

A codebase-wide search confirms none of these exports are imported anywhere. All locale pages correctly use the builder functions (buildHotelSchema, buildAboutUsSchema, etc.) with the active locale. These static exports execute at module load time on every import of lib/schema.ts, wasting compute and keeping dead code in the module surface.

Files to fix:
- lib/schema.ts: remove lines 461-466 (the static export constants)

Acceptance criteria:
- The six static schema export constants are removed
- All existing callers (app/[locale]/* pages) still use the builder functions and compile correctly
- Run npm run build and confirm it succeeds with no TypeScript errors

Review of dekyil-v2-15b found: the 6 dead static schema export constants were never removed from lib/schema.ts.

Commit d173831 was labeled 'cleanup: remove dead static schema export constants' but its actual diff only added a line to .beads/issues.jsonl. lib/schema.ts was not modified.

Current state — lib/schema.ts lines 460-465 still contain:
  export const AboutUsSchema = buildAboutUsSchema("en", "/about-us")
  export const SuiteRoomSchema = buildSuiteRoomSchema("en")
  export const DeluxeRoomSchema = buildDeluxeRoomSchema("en")
  export const DeluxeBreadCrumb = buildDeluxeBreadCrumb("en")
  export const SuiteBreadCrumb = buildSuiteBreadCrumb("en")
  export const HotelSchema = buildHotelSchema("en")

Evidence: grep -n '^export const AboutUsSchema\|^export const SuiteRoomSchema\|^export const DeluxeRoomSchema\|^export const DeluxeBreadCrumb\|^export const SuiteBreadCrumb\|^export const HotelSchema' lib/schema.ts returns all 6 lines. git show d173831 -- lib/schema.ts shows no diff.

These exports are confirmed unused — no file outside lib/schema.ts imports any of them (all callers use the builder functions directly). They execute at module load time on every import of lib/schema.ts, wasting compute.

Files to fix:
- lib/schema.ts: remove lines 460-465 (the 6 static export constants) and the preceding comment block (lines 456-459)

Acceptance criteria:
- The six static schema export constants are removed from lib/schema.ts
- The comment block 'Backwards-compatible English-default exports' is also removed
- All existing callers (app/[locale]/* pages) still use the builder functions and compile correctly
- Run npm run build and confirm it succeeds with no TypeScript errors
